st where page 0 ended, skipping the last item of page 0\n\n**Fix:** Remove the `+ 1`\n\n```\noffset = page * pageSize\n```\n\nNow:\n- Page 0: offset = 0 → starts at item 0 ✓\n- Page 1: offset = pageSize → starts exactly after page 0 ends ✓\n\nThe `+ 1` was likely added by someone confusing 1-indexed pages (page 1, 2, 3…) with 0-indexed pages (page 0, 1, 2…), or as a failed fix for a different bug upstream.","ttft_ms":3949,"type":"result","duration_ms":6497,"uuid":"cdddd36b-6eaf-41b6-94c1-db611aae6da7","ttft_stream_ms":813,"time_to_request_ms":119,"first_content_frame_ms":814,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0,"model_usage_since_last_result":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":10,"outputTokens":610,"cacheReadInputTokens":7913,"cacheCreationInputTokens":542,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.0049353,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000,"thinkingTokens":350,"cacheCreationEphemeral5mInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationEphemeral1hInputTokens":542,"canonicalModel":"claude-haiku-4-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"}},"credential_expires_at":"2026-12-12T05:14:51.381Z"}